+/* 2026-10-20 Dreadwatch: the threat-domain list on its own page (it used to be a card on the
+   Warden page). Settings: rwarden_dns / rwarden_dns_feeds (nvram, this form) and the
+   exemption names (the /jffs list store, save_lists). Status, counters and the self-test:
+   reaper_warden.cgi action=dns_status / dns_test / dns_reset, behind the http_id gate.
+   Everything the router reports is rendered with textContent. */
